(Vise stop: use the tool in the spindle as a hard stop for a self-centering vise.)
(Writes the free-axis origin of the vise WCS from the stored stop position and the)
(tool diameter, then parks the tool at the stop so the part can be slid against it.)
(Retract with o<vise_stop_retract> call after clamping.  See docs/VISE_STOP.md)
(Set by the VISE STOP tab - persistent in linuxcnc.var:)
(  #5580 free axis along the jaws: 0 = X, 1 = Y)
(  #5581 part side of the stop: +1 = part toward +, -1 = part toward -)
(  #5582 stop position, machine coord on the free axis - spindle centerline)
(  #5583 stop Z - tool tip height in the vise WCS)
(  #5584 origin mode: 0 = part edge at the stop, 1 = part center)
(  #5585 part length along the free axis - center mode only)
(  #5586 vise WCS: 1 = G54 ... 6 = G59)
(  #5587 last free-axis origin written, machine coord - read back by the tab)

o<vise_stop_go> sub
  #<axis> = #5580
  #<side> = #5581
  #<stop> = #5582
  #<stop_z> = #5583
  #<mode> = #5584
  #<length> = #5585
  #<wcs> = #5586

  (--- refuse anything we cannot trust - never guess a position ---)
  o100 if [#5400 LE 0]
    (ABORT, Vise stop: no tool in the spindle - load the stop pin with M600 first)
  o100 endif
  o101 if [#5400 EQ #3014]
    (ABORT, Vise stop: touch probe is loaded - use a pin or tool as the stop)
  o101 endif
  #<dia> = #5410
  o102 if [#<dia> LE 0]
    (ABORT, Vise stop: loaded tool has no diameter in the tool table)
  o102 endif
  o103 if [[#<wcs> LT 1] OR [#<wcs> GT 6]]
    (ABORT, Vise stop: vise WCS must be G54 to G59)
  o103 endif
  o104 if [[#<axis> NE 0] AND [#<axis> NE 1]]
    (ABORT, Vise stop: free axis must be X or Y)
  o104 endif
  o105 if [[#<side> NE 1] AND [#<side> NE -1]]
    (ABORT, Vise stop: part side must be + or -)
  o105 endif
  o106 if [ABS[#<stop>] LT 0.0001]
    (ABORT, Vise stop: stop position not captured - jog to the stop and press CAPTURE STOP)
  o106 endif

  #<base> = [5201 + 20 * #<wcs>]
  (Clamp axis = the other one; the self-centering vise holds it at the calibrated WCS value)
  #<clamp> = #[#<base> + 1 - #<axis>]
  #<wcs_z> = #[#<base> + 2]
  o107 if [ABS[#<clamp>] LT 0.0001]
    (ABORT, Vise stop: vise WCS clamp axis is zero - probe the vise center into it once)
  o107 endif
  o108 if [ABS[#<wcs_z>] LT 0.0001]
    (ABORT, Vise stop: vise WCS Z is zero - set Z on the parallels or vise once)
  o108 endif

  G21 G90 G94 G40
  G43 H#5400
  (WCS Z + tool length + active G92 = machine Z of the tip at vise Z0)
  #<z_to_mach> = [#<wcs_z> + #5403 + [#5210 * #5213]]
  o115 if [[#<stop_z> + #<z_to_mach>] GT -1]
    (ABORT, Vise stop: stop Z lands above machine Z0 - check STOP Z and the tool length)
  o115 endif

  (--- free-axis origin: stop centerline plus tool radius toward the part ---)
  #<origin> = [#<stop> + #<side> * #<dia> / 2]
  o110 if [#<mode> GT 0.5]
    o111 if [#<length> LE 0]
      (ABORT, Vise stop: center mode needs the part length)
    o111 endif
    #<origin> = [#<origin> + #<side> * #<length> / 2]
  o110 endif

  o112 if [#<axis> EQ 0]
    G10 L2 P#<wcs> X#<origin>
  o112 else
    G10 L2 P#<wcs> Y#<origin>
  o112 endif
  #5587 = #<origin>

  (--- park the tool at the stop: retract first, then XY, then down in the vise WCS ---)
  #<old_wcs> = #5220
  M5
  G53 G0 Z0
  o120 if [#<axis> EQ 0]
    G53 G0 X#<stop> Y#<clamp>
  o120 else
    G53 G0 X#<clamp> Y#<stop>
  o120 endif

  o130 if [#<wcs> EQ 1]
    G54
  o130 elseif [#<wcs> EQ 2]
    G55
  o130 elseif [#<wcs> EQ 3]
    G56
  o130 elseif [#<wcs> EQ 4]
    G57
  o130 elseif [#<wcs> EQ 5]
    G58
  o130 else
    G59
  o130 endif

  (rapid to 25 mm above the stop only if that stays below machine Z0, then feed)
  o135 if [[#<stop_z> + 25 + #<z_to_mach>] LT -1]
    G0 Z[#<stop_z> + 25]
  o135 endif
  G1 Z#<stop_z> F600

  (restore the coordinate system that was active before)
  o140 if [#<old_wcs> EQ 1]
    G54
  o140 elseif [#<old_wcs> EQ 2]
    G55
  o140 elseif [#<old_wcs> EQ 3]
    G56
  o140 elseif [#<old_wcs> EQ 4]
    G57
  o140 elseif [#<old_wcs> EQ 5]
    G58
  o140 elseif [#<old_wcs> EQ 6]
    G59
  o140 elseif [#<old_wcs> EQ 7]
    G59.1
  o140 elseif [#<old_wcs> EQ 8]
    G59.2
  o140 else
    G59.3
  o140 endif
o<vise_stop_go> endsub

M2
